# No environment variables are required to run this app -- price data
# (yfinance) and the risk-free rate (U.S. Treasury Fiscal Data API) are
# both free and keyless.
#
# Optional: override which frontend origins the backend accepts requests
# from (comma-separated). Defaults to Vite's local dev port.
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
